'''Carl Zeus Issariotis''' (born June 26, 1981 in [[Toronto]], [[Ontario]]) is a Canadian [[figure skater]] who currently represents [[Greece]] internationally. He is the 2004 & 2006 Greek national champion. He previously competed representing Canada, most notably on the [[Junior Grand Prix]] circuit, but switched to representing Greece after taking a break from competitive skating.<ref name=skatetoday/>

